Changed: ingress-nginx controller upgraded to v1.13.9. Update `values/ingress-nginx-controller/values.yaml` before upgrading: set `controller.image.tag: "v1.13.9"`, `controller.admissionWebhooks.patch.image.tag: "v1.6.9"` and `controller.config.annotations-risk-level: Critical` (under `ingress-nginx:`), see `values/ingress-nginx-controller/prod-values.example.yaml`. Without `annotations-risk-level: Critical`, controller >= v1.12 rejects the nginx-ingress-services ingresses that use `*-snippet` annotations (`annotation group ServerSnippet contains risky annotation`). Upgrade `ingress-nginx-controller` before `nginx-ingress-services`. See `offline/upgrades/ingress-nginx-controller-v1.13.md` (WPB-26631)
